# The plugin binary, under BOTH names it can be built as:
#   openbao-plugin-secrets-netbird  what the Dockerfile and `moon run :build` produce
#   openbao-netbird-plugin          what a bare `go build ./...` produces (named after the dir)
# Only the first was listed, so the second ended up as a 21 MB compiled binary tracked in git.
openbao-plugin-secrets-netbird
openbao-netbird-plugin
